{"type": "info", "prompt": "RULES FOR ALL (paste once first)\nYou write X posts for me as \"Swanix\", an anon Web3 builder. Confident, plain words, no hype clichés, max 2 emojis, max 2 hashtags. Never use my real name or face. Always tag @fhenix. I've built on Fhenix CoFHE testnet (encrypted quiz grading contract). Never copy Fhenix announcement copy verbatim. Give me the post plus one 1080x1350 dark infographic with cyan accents and big phone-readable text.\n\n1) TRY GENESIS (25 credits)\nI used genesis.fhenix.io on Arbitrum: shielded [amount/token], sent [amount]. Screenshots attached. Smooth: [ ]. Surprised: [ ]. Would change: [ ]. Write a quote tweet for the Genesis announcement covering smooth / surprised / change. Infographic: 3 panels (Shield, Send, Verdict). Blur all addresses and balances.\n\n2) GUY'S HOTTEST TAKE (30 credits)\nQuote tweet the Fhenix mainnet interview with @GuyZys. The take that stuck with me: dual-mode assets, where one token can be public or private and the holder chooses. Explain why it matters: privacy becomes a toggle instead of a separate chain or mixer, you keep composability, and institutions can live with it. Infographic: \"Public ⇄ Private, same token\".\n\n3) ALPHAENGINE LIVE (20 credits)\nAnnouncement: [https://x.com/fhenix/status/2112914768013267372]. AlphaEngine is confidential DeFi execution that hides trade intents and strategy details to cut MEV and enable private strategy competition. Write my take: what I'd use it for (running a strategy without getting front-run or copy-traded), and what encrypted compute unlocks (strategies stay secret even while executing onchain). Infographic: \"Public mempool vs AlphaEngine\".\n\n4) OBOLOS LIVE (20 credits)\nAnnouncement: [https://x.com/fhenix/status/2112902269180243998]. Obolos is protocol-level compliance for tokenized equity, enforcing accreditation, jurisdiction, transfer and cap-table rules. The use case I'm most excited about: startups and private companies putting cap tables onchain, with compliance checks running on encrypted investor data, so rules are enforced without doxxing holders. Infographic: \"Compliant AND private\".\n\n5) MAINNET CREATOR TAKE (40 credits)\nOriginal post, no announcement copy. In my own words: what changes now that dual-mode assets are live on Fhenix mainnet? Points: privacy is no longer a separate wrapped token, the same asset keeps its liquidity and DeFi composability, use cases are payroll, treasuries, trade size and RWAs, and FHE is quantum-resistant. A 4-tweet thread with a strong hook. I'll attach my existing infographic, post11-mainnet-take.\n\n6) BUILD WITH DUAL MODE (35 credits)\nPitch an app I'd build: \"Unravix Proof\", a learning app where quiz answer keys and student scores stay encrypted onchain, and students can flip a credential public (\"mastered X\") when applying for jobs, private by default. Same token, no wrapping. Explain why dual mode makes it possible. I'll attach my existing infographic, post12-build-dual-mode.", "source": {"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Dual-Mode Assets on Fhenix</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root {\n  --bg: #070B14;\n  --card: #0D1626;\n  --card-subtle: #121E33;\n  --border: #1E304D;\n  --border-cyan: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35);\n  --cyan: #00F0FF;\n  --cyan-glow: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.14);\n  --cyan-dim: #79F6FF;\n  --red-dim: #FF6685;\n  --text: #F8FAFC;\n  --muted: #94A3B8;\n  --font-mono: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1920px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\nmain {\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1920px;\n  padding: 64px 68px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n/* Header */\n.header {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.kicker-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.badge {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  background: var(--cyan-glow);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-cyan);\n  padding: 6px 14px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n}\n.kicker-label {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 68px;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\nh1 span {\n  color: var(--cyan);\n}\n.subtitle {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 26px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\n/* Hero: State Machine Visual */\n.hero-card {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #101B2E 0%, var(--card) 100%);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-cyan);\n  box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);\n  border-radius: 28px;\n  padding: 32px 36px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 22px;\n}\n.hero-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n}\n.hero-title {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n.hero-tag {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.state-machine {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 140px 1fr;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  background: rgba(6, 11, 20, 0.6);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  padding: 26px 28px;\n}\n.state-box {\n  background: var(--card-subtle);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 22px 24px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.state-box.active-private {\n  border-color: var(--border-cyan);\n  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0e2238 0%, #0d1a2c 100%);\n}\n.state-tag {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 19px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.state-box.public .state-tag { color: var(--muted); }\n.state-box.active-private .state-tag { color: var(--cyan); }\n.state-headline {\n  font-size: 26px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0 0 6px;\n}\n.state-desc {\n  font-size: 21px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n.transition-col {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n.toggle-badge {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 19px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  text-align: center;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n/* Comparison Matrix */\n.matrix-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 22px;\n}\n.compare-card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 28px 30px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n.compare-card.fhenix-card {\n  border-color: var(--border-cyan);\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #101c30 0%, #0d1727 100%);\n}\n.card-label-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n.card-label {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 21px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.bad-tag { color: var(--red-dim); }\n.good-tag { color: var(--cyan); }\n\n.pill-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.pill-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 23px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n.pill-icon {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  margin-top: 3px;\n}\n.compare-card p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\n/* Use Cases Section */\n.usecases-title {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n.usecases-title h2 {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin: 0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n.usecases-title span {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n}\n\n.usecase-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n.usecase-card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n.usecase-icon-box {\n  width: 52px;\n  height: 52px;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  background: var(--card-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n.usecase-card h3 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 26px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n}\n.usecase-card .app-sub {\n  font-size: 19px;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-top: -8px;\n}\n.usecase-card p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 21px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n/* Cryptographic Specs / Alpha Bar */\n.spec-strip {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 24px 32px;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 24px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.spec-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n.spec-item:not(:last-child) {\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--border);\n  padding-right: 20px;\n}\n.spec-val {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 34px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n.spec-label {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text);\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n.spec-sub {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  line-height: 1.25;\n}\n\n/* Footer */\nfooter {\n  margin-top: auto;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding-top: 14px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.footer-left {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 14px;\n  font-size: 21px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n.footer-handle {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n.footer-right {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 20px;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"kicker-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">EVM ARCHITECTURE</span>\n      <span class=\"kicker-label\">Swanix Deep Dive // @fhenix</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1>Public ⇄ Private<br><span>Same Token. Same Pool.</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Why dual-mode assets eliminate mixers, preserve unified liquidity, and bring institutional confidentiality directly onto the EVM.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Hero Visual: Dual Mode Mechanics -->\n  <section class=\"hero-card\">\n    <div class=\"hero-header\">\n      <div class=\"hero-title\">Dual-Mode State Machine</div>\n      <div class=\"hero-tag\">Native FHE Primitives</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"state-machine\">\n      <div class=\"state-box public\">\n        <div class=\"state-tag\">State A: Public</div>\n        <div class=\"state-headline\">ERC-20 Visible</div>\n        <p class=\"state-desc\">Normal DEX routing, AMM trading, open wallet balances, standard EVM calls.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"transition-col\">\n        <svg width=\"64\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 40\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M4 14H54M54 14L44 4M54 14L44 24\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M60 26H10M10 26L20 16M10 26L20 36\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"toggle-badge\">Shield<br>⇄ Unshield</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"state-box active-private\">\n        <div class=\"state-tag\">State B: Confidential</div>\n        <div class=\"state-headline\">FHE Encrypted</div>\n        <p class=\"state-desc\">Encrypted balances via <code style=\"color:var(--cyan);font-family:var(--font-mono);\">euint128</code>. Computations execute without decrypting.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Comparison Matrix -->\n  <section class=\"matrix-grid\">\n    <div class=\"compare-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-label-row\">\n        <span class=\"card-label bad-tag\">Legacy Privacy Silos</span>\n        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\">\n          <circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"14\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#FF6685\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M9 9L19 19M19 9L9 19\" stroke=\"#FF6685\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pill-list\">\n        <div class=\"pill-item\">\n          <span class=\"pill-icon\" style=\"color:var(--red-dim)\">✕</span>\n          <span><b>Fractured Liquidity:</b> Requires wrapped tokens (e.g. wZEC) or separate isolation pools.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pill-item\">\n          <span class=\"pill-icon\" style=\"color:var(--red-dim)\">✕</span>\n          <span><b>Zero Composability:</b> Isolated app-chains break synchronous smart contract composability.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pill-item\">\n          <span class=\"pill-icon\" style=\"color:var(--red-dim)\">✕</span>\n          <span><b>Compliance Hostile:</b> Binary all-or-nothing privacy flags accounts for institutional blacklisting.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"compare-card fhenix-card\">\n      <div class=\"card-label-row\">\n        <span class=\"card-label good-tag\">Fhenix Dual-Mode</span>\n        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\">\n          <circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"14\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M8 14L12 18L20 10\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pill-list\">\n        <div class=\"pill-item\">\n          <span class=\"pill-icon\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">✓</span>\n          <span><b>One Contract Address:</b> The asset retains identity, market depth, and instant DEX liquidity.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pill-item\">\n          <span class=\"pill-icon\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">✓</span>\n          <span><b>Full EVM Composability:</b> Confidential logic executes natively alongside existing DeFi protocols.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pill-item\">\n          <span class=\"pill-icon\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">✓</span>\n          <span><b>Selective Auditability:</b> Granular view keys allow compliance checks without publicly doxxing balances.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Applications Live on Fhenix -->\n  <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px;\">\n    <div class=\"usecases-title\">\n      <h2>What Encrypted Compute Unlocks</h2>\n      <span>LIVE APPS &amp; USE CASES</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"usecase-grid\">\n      <!-- AlphaEngine -->\n      <div class=\"usecase-card\">\n        <div class=\"usecase-icon-box\">\n          <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M14 3L23 8V15C23 20.5 19 24 14 26C9 24 5 20.5 5 15V8L14 3Z\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10 14L13 17L18 11\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>AlphaEngine</h3>\n          <div class=\"app-sub\">Confidential DeFi Execution</div>\n        </div>\n        <p>Hides trade intents and strategy sizing in the public mempool. Eliminates toxic MEV sandwiches and stops copy-traders dead in their tracks.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Obolos -->\n      <div class=\"usecase-card\">\n        <div class=\"usecase-icon-box\">\n          <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\">\n            <rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M14 11V17M11 14H17\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Obolos Protocol</h3>\n          <div class=\"app-sub\">Cap Tables &amp; Compliance</div>\n        </div>\n        <p>Private startup equity onchain. Enforces investor accreditation, jurisdictions, and cap-table limits on encrypted inputs without revealing cap sheets.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Unravix / Real Economy -->\n      <div class=\"usecase-card\">\n        <div class=\"usecase-icon-box\">\n          <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M4 10L14 4L24 10L14 16L4 10Z\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M7 14.5V20L14 24L21 20V14.5\" stroke=\"#00F0FF\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Unravix Proof</h3>\n          <div class=\"app-sub\">Confidential Credentials</div>\n        </div>\n        <p>Encrypted quiz grading and salary payroll. Answer keys and scores compute privately, granting public verifiable credentials on demand.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Cryptographic Hardware Specs / Guardrails -->\n  <section class=\"spec-strip\">\n    <div class=\"spec-item\">\n      <div class=\"spec-val\">TFHE</div>\n      <div class=\"spec-label\">Fully Homomorphic</div>\n      <div class=\"spec-sub\">Computes directly over encrypted ciphertexts onchain.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"spec-item\">\n      <div class=\"spec-val\">LWE</div>\n      <div class=\"spec-label\">Quantum-Resistant</div>\n      <div class=\"spec-sub\">Lattice-based cryptography immune to Shor's algorithm.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"spec-item\">\n      <div class=\"spec-val\">0x</div>\n      <div class=\"spec-label\">Zero Liquidity Split</div>\n      <div class=\"spec-sub\">Shielded &amp; public states share the exact same underlying ERC-20.</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">\n      <span class=\"footer-handle\">Swanix</span>\n      <span>•</span>\n      <span>Builder on Fhenix CoFHE Testnet to Mainnet</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-right\">fhenix.io // genesis.fhenix.io</div>\n  </footer>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>", "size": [1080, 1920]}, "edits": [], "created": 1792672339.6983297}